V2: width/emphasis optional, accepted for compatibility but ignored; composition fixes geometry/hierarchy. No unknown keys, nulls, HTML/CSS, font knobs or nested Liquid. All strings are content, escaped once; template source is never evaluated from payload strings. Bounds are maxima, not fit guarantees; shorten rather than auto-shrink. Use authorized current facts; do not invent meetings/tasks/metrics; identify sample/unknown data; updated_at=honest human-readable content timestamp, not server refresh time. Prior payload is fictional sample data.
DESIGN_TOKENS_JSON=@@DESIGN_TOKENS_JSON@@
DESIGN: black/white; no gray small text; sans Arial/Helvetica, large editorial serif Georgia. V2 decorative bottom footer forbidden; timestamps only in readable top metadata. CSS px>=16 everywhere; px<=16 requires weight>=600; metadata16/700/22, body18/400/26, section18/700/24. Large serif headings may be400. No shrinking below floor. Whitespace/rules/asymmetry group content; avoid repeated cards; one inverse region: spotlight hero or calendar today. CALENDAR: agent supplies dates/weekdays/countdowns (renderer does no date math); month first_weekday 1=Mon; marked=circled, today=filled. Legacy v1 grid retains a readable >=16/700 title bar; no tiny-footer style exists.
VALIDATE locally before push if runtime/files available: npm run validate -- payload.json; npm run test:design (tests/design.mjs)=>Chrome render nine compositions, computed text size/weight floor, no .dui-footer, section overflow; npm test=>build+legacy+design. These scripts/schema source live in the local package, NOT callable TRMNL MCP tools; MCP data-write does NOT enforce this custom contract. If unavailable, validate JSON against inline schema+EXTRA_VALIDATION, request server preview, inspect; do not claim local checks ran.
PREVIEW: startPreview({plugin_setting_id:"522048",device_model:"v2",size:"markup_full"})=>job_id; getPreview({plugin_setting_id:"522048",id:job_id})=>status/image; pending=>retry with backoff; complete=>save/display preview_base64 immediately (read consumes result). Local800x480 != device-model proportions; server preview still != physical-screen verification. Do not alter playlist/device settings for routine data pushes. startRefresh({plugin_setting_id:"522048"}) queues rendering; physical display waits for check-in/button. No daily content generator is scheduled by this template.
LEGACY: schema_version=1, no layout; same heading/updated_at/block content fields; width required half|full; optional emphasis normal|important; max4 blocks; slots=0; for b: half=>slots++; full=>slots+=slots%2+2; require slots<=4. Prefer v2. Changing renderer/design: edit source+tokens, npm run build, npm test, writeMarkup dist/full.liquid, server-preview. Preserve/regenerate this comment when modifying templates. Repo: {docs/design-system.md,src/design/tokens.json,scripts/build.mjs,src/schemas/v2.json,src/validate-v2.mjs,tests/design.mjs}; local paths are not remote MCP resources. No secrets in this contract.
